		(property "Description" "16-bit I/O expander, address 0x77. Plain PCA9539 only (PCA9539R resets only the I2C interface). TSSOP-24, three makers with the same pin-out (D-133): NXP/Nexperia PCA9539PW,118, TI TCA9539PWR, Diodes PI4IOE5V9539LEX. No I/O pull-ups; RESET sets all I/O as inputs"
